{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["#","^title: Ramen Talk: Empathy Module","/#","#","^author: a_suozhang","/#","ev","str","^开始对话 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_001"},"\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",null]}],"done",{"beat_001":[["^凌晨一点十七分。高架桥的阴影压在一排自动售货机和公共拉面摊上。列车每隔几分钟从头顶驶过，塑料棚便跟着轻轻发颤。雨水沿棚布的折痕汇成细流，在排水槽里泛着广告屏的蓝光。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_002"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_002":[["^摊位只有六个座位。最外侧的两个被雨打湿，最里面的两个正对着一枚市政摄像头。星沢真选了中间偏左的位置：既能从不锈钢汤锅的反光里看见街口，也不会正对镜头。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_003"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_003":[["^他没有脱深色外套。多层AR镜片架在鼻梁上，最外侧的透明镜页随远处车辆的灯光自动收缩。一根像香烟、牙签或诊断探针的细棍叼在嘴角，没有点燃。拆下来的筷子纸套被他折成窄而平整的长条，压在碗底。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_004"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_004":[["^黑崎诺埃坐在右边。旧黑色皮衣敞着，领口以下几乎全是深色钛合金：胸骨位置的装甲板随呼吸模拟器缓慢起伏，板缝里偶尔闪过极弱的琥珀色。金属结构一直延伸到颈侧，脸上却没有任何接口。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_005"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_005":[["^两碗拉面同时冒着热气。Makoto已经吃掉三分之一，叉烧和笋片被分在碗的两侧，筷子每次落下都避开汤面的油花。Noé的碗保持着端上来时的样子，溏心蛋没有切开，海苔仍靠在碗沿。他一直盯着沉在汤里的面，筷子横放在桌上。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_006"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_006":[["^摊主背对两人清洗滤网，没有加入谈话。头顶的电子价目表每隔三十秒弹出一次“市民夜间营养补助已计入结算”。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_007"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_007":[["^这不是上次那碗面。 ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_008"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_008":[["^那碗面如果还在，老板应该先向卫生部门自首。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_009"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_009":[["^面换了，汤重新熬过，碗也不一定是这只。招牌没换，所以还叫同一个名字。 ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_010"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_010":[["^你终于发现餐馆不是文物了？ ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_011"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_011":[["^人是不是也这样？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_012"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_012":[["^Makoto把夹起的面送入口中，咀嚼完才抬了一下眼。镜片最内层掠过一行无法从外侧看清的字符，又迅速消失。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_013"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_013":[["^身体可以换，名字也可以换。别人还照原来的方式跟他说话，就算还是原来的人？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_014"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_014":[["^材料没那么重要。让一个人保持连续的，是记忆、叙事，还有别人能不能预测他。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_015"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_015":[["^说人话。 ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_016"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_016":[["^你每天都用差不多的方式让人失望，别人就相信你还是你。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_017"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_017":[["^所以人格就是重复？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_018"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_018":[["^是别人记得住的重复。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_019"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_019":[["^装出来的也算？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_020"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_020":[["^装得足够久，就没有原版可以对照了。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: counter","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_021"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_021":[["^Noé拿起筷子，在面中央缓慢分开一道缝。汤汁很快重新合拢。他没有夹起任何东西。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_022"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_022":[["^我见客户的时候会笑，会说理解他们。客户走了，我连他们叫什么都不记得。刚才那个算我吗？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_023"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_023":[["^算。社会人格不是赝品，是接口。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_024"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_024":[["^不同的人用不同接口？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_025"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_025":[["^客户、陌生人、搭档，各自只能访问你允许他们访问的版本。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_026"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_026":[["^哪个版本是真的？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_027"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_027":[["^没有哪个更真。所谓本人，也许只是这些版本里始终不肯改变的部分。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_028"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_028":[["^那你所有版本里，始终不肯改变的是什么？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_029"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_029":[["^Makoto把一片叉烧从汤里翻过来，切口朝下，动作像是在给某种小型零件重新定位。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_030"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_030":[["^至少不是拿一碗面当哲学。你的比较好测——输入拉面，输出一句“都行”，人格校验通过。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_031"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_031":[["^塑料棚外，一辆清洁车从积水中驶过，车顶的消毒灯把两人的影子压在桌面上。Makoto嘴角的细棍仍微微上扬。Noé没有笑，也没有像平时那样耸肩。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: identity","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_032"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_032":[["^为什么一问到你，你就开始讲我？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: defense","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_033"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_033":[["^因为你比较简单。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: defense","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_034"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_034":[["^还是因为我以前不会继续问？ ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: defense","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_035"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_035":[["^Makoto用舌尖把细棍换到另一边。镜片上映出的笑意比脸上更明显。 ","#","^SPEAKER: narration ","/#","#","^CLASS: environment ","/#","#","^SCENE: defense","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_036"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_036":[["^今天售后升级了？ ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: defense","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_037"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_037":[["^你又在讲我。 ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: defense","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_038"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_038":[["^好。继续。 ","#","^SPEAKER: makoto ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: defense","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"beat_039"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],null],"beat_039":[["^你说人格是别人记得住的重复。这个就是你的重复。 ","#","^SPEAKER: noe ","/#","#","^CLASS: character ","/#","#","^SCENE: defense","/#","\n","ev","str","^继续 ▸","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",